title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/file-manager:activate
catalog: GUI command
target: file-manager:activate
summary: File manager: go into the folder / show the file (here / other / new)

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``file-manager`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``b enter`` → ``file-manager:activate new`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
* ``enter`` → ``file-manager:activate other`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
* ``i enter`` → ``file-manager:activate here`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
